==Organisation==

===Emblem===
The official emblem of the tournament was unveiled in [[Casablanca]] on 2 September 2013.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.fifa.com/clubworldcup/organisation/media/newsid=2166433/index.html|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20130904230017/http://www.fifa.com/clubworldcup/organisation/media/newsid=2166433/index.html|url-status=dead|archive-date=4 September 2013|title=Official emblem unveiled|publisher=FIFA.com|date=2 September 2013}}</ref>

===Ticketing===
Pre-sale tickets were available from 14 to 27 October 2013, while the open sales phase began on 28 October 2013.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.fifa.com/clubworldcup/news/newsid=2190904/index.html|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20131005101324/http://www.fifa.com/clubworldcup/news/newsid=2190904/index.html|url-status=dead|archive-date=5 October 2013|title=Ticketing details announced for Morocco 2013|publisher=FIFA.com|date=5 October 2013}}</ref>

===Trophy tour===
A tour of the [[FIFA Club World Cup#Trophy|FIFA Club World Cup Trophy]] took place from October to December 2013, starting from [[Yokohama]], the site of the [[2012 FIFA Club World Cup Final]], before visiting the cities of each participating team, and ending at [[Casablanca]] before the start of the tournament.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.fifa.com/clubworldcup/organisation/media/newsid=2198810/index.html|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20131021035229/http://www.fifa.com/clubworldcup/organisation/media/newsid=2198810/index.html|url-status=dead|archive-date=21 October 2013|title=FIFA Club World Cup Welcome Tour kicks off in Yokohama|publisher=FIFA.com|date=18 October 2013}}</ref>

